    "body": "I have published the package [mini-snippets-mutt.nvim](https://github.com/shuber2/mini-snippets-mutt.nvim), which are Lua-based snippets from mutt configurations for **signatures** and **from-addresses**.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I have published the package <a href=\"https://github.com/shuber2/mini-snippets-mutt.nvim\">mini-snippets-mutt.nvim</a>, which are Lua-based snippets from mutt configurations for <strong>signatures</strong> and <strong>from-addresses</strong>.</p>",
    "bodyText": "I have published the package mini-snippets-mutt.nvim, which are Lua-based snippets from mutt configurations for signatures and from-addresses.",
